            "notes": "The main focus of this deck is to utilize the aggressive abilities and synergies of Judith, the Scourge Diva to deal damage quickly and efficiently to the opponent. The deck contains a mix of low-cost creatures with abilities that trigger when they die, allowing for repeated damage output. Cards like Goblin Bombardment and Gravecrawler help to maximize the damage potential, while cards like Bloodsoaked Champion and Knight of the Ebon Legion provide additional combat prowess. Additionally, the deck includes removal spells like Dismember and Fatal Push to deal with opposing threats, as well as card advantage options like Skullclamp and Demonic Tutor to ensure a steady stream of resources to maintain pressure on the opponent."
